	(text "Icorms = (Vout * (Vin - Vout)) / (sqrt(12) * Vin * Lo * fsw)\n = 6.6 * (14.4 - 6.6) / (3.464 * 14.4 * 3.3e-6 * 588e3)\n = 0.531A"
